<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-AUSTRALIA 204-5 AT LUNCH VS SOUTH AFRICA.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-AUSTRALIA 204-5 AT LUNCH VS SOUTH AFRICA.</headline>
<dateline>PORT ELIZABETH 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia, needing 270 for victory, were 204 for five wickets at lunch on the third day of the second test against South Africa in Port Elizabeth on Monday.</p>
<p>Scores:</p>
<p>South Africa 209 and 168. Australia 108 and 204-5 (Mark Waugh 86 not out).</p>
